@IndiaTVNews, this is a serious matter! A 100% AI-generated fake news image is being circulated using INDIA TV’s name, falsely portraying Kaashvi Hirandani as running a negative PR campaign against Qazi Touqeer. This fabricated article misuses your brand identity to spread misinformation and damage Kaashvi’s reputation.

We urge INDIA TV to investigate the alleged involvement of Qazi Touqeer’s PR team and his wife in spreading or promoting this fake narrative, and take appropriate action if evidence supports it. Such deliberate fabrication must not go unchecked. Please issue a clarification and take strict action against those responsible for misusing your trusted brand name.

#IndiaTV #FakeNews #BiggBoss20 #ScoutOP
